	(text "Sega Master System / SMS2 50-pin cartridge slot, drawn by function (finger numbers on the pins).\nEven pins 2-50 on the component (label) side, which faces the console front; odd pins behind them;\npins 1/2 at the right seen from the front with the fingers down (tools/audit/edge_orientation.py).\nUnused console outputs (left) stay open.  /CONT and /BUSREQ end on test pads only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
